---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer | Best Cities in Spain"
  description="Affiliate disclosure, travel information disclaimer, and independence statement for bestcitiesinspain.com."
>
  <div style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 1.5rem;">
    <h1
      class="font-bold mb-8"
      style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; color: #1A1A1A; font-size: 2.25rem; line-height: 1.2;"
    >
      Disclaimer
    </h1>

    <div class="prose-city">
      <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you book or purchase through them, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. This never influences our recommendations — we only link to services we'd genuinely use or recommend.
      </p>

      <h2>Travel Information</h2>
      <p>
        Travel conditions, prices, visa requirements, local regulations, and practical details change frequently. The information on this site reflects our best knowledge at the time of writing. Always verify current information through official sources before travelling.
      </p>

      <h2>Independence</h2>
      <p>
        Best Cities in Spain is not affiliated with any Spanish tourism board, government body, hotel chain, airline, or tour operator. All editorial decisions are made independently. We do not accept payment for coverage or placement.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
